data: {"id": "b9e5d81a31c84e2e-thinking-parallel_evidence-2722", "run_id": "b9e5d81a31c84e2e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 采集事实\n\n- **Prometheus (Metrics):** `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending`，`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=\"ContainerCreating\"`，重启次数为 0。确认 Pod 当前仍处于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态。\n- **Elasticsearch (Logs):** 30 分钟窗口内无日志记录（`coverage=empty`）。符合 Pod 未启动的预期。\n- **DeepFlow/Tempo (Tracing):** 由于 Pod 未分配 IP (`pod_ip is empty`)，无流量或 Span 记录。符合预期。\n- **Kubernetes (Describe/YAML):** Pod `workload` 在 `node2` 上处于 `Pending` 状态。定义的 volume `input` 类型为 `HostPath`，指向路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f3", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789126981802, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

